1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:04,752
Regarde ! La ville est en danger !
Look! The city is in danger!

2
00:00:05,252 --> 00:00:08,804
Oh non ! Que se passe-t-il ?
Oh no! What's happening?

3
00:00:09,304 --> 00:00:12,040
Un méchant attaque la ville !
A villain is attacking the city!

4
00:00:12,540 --> 00:00:16,332
Vite ! Nous devons l'arrêter !
Quick! We must stop him!

5
00:00:16,832 --> 00:00:20,528
Attention ! Il arrive !
Watch out! He's coming!

6
00:00:21,028 --> 00:00:22,924
Ne bouge pas !
Don't move!

7
00:00:23,424 --> 00:00:26,640
Ensemble, nous sommes plus forts !
Together, we are stronger!

8
00:00:27,140 --> 00:00:29,012
Attrape-le !
Catch him!

9
00:00:29,512 --> 00:00:31,384
Je l'ai !
I've got him!

10
00:00:31,884 --> 00:00:34,764
Bravo, La ville est sauvée !
Well done, The city is saved!

11
00:00:35,264 --> 00:00:37,448
C'est notre mission !
It's our mission!

12
00:00:37,948 --> 00:00:40,756
Allez, rentrons à la maison !
Come on, let's go home!

